  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help get a new home for our twin friends</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twins Adriangeles &amp; Adriangely come from San Luis, Maracaibo, Venezuela. They lost their father to Huntington&apos;s disease (HD) &amp; they have been raised by their grandmother in vulnerable conditions. Their grandmother also cares for her husband, who has HD. Factor-H is an NGO that cares for people with this devastating, genetic, fatal disease. The girls have a 50% chance of developing HD. We want to rebuild their home so they have a suitable place to grow up in. please consider helping them! Thanks!</narrative>
  </description>
